              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi mataifa higa gamuogopha Mwenyezi Mlungu ela piya ahumikira vizuka vyao vya kutsongbwa aho na ana aho na ana a ana aho na anaenderera kuhenda vivyo hivyo dza akare aho arivyohenda hadi rero.",
          "type": "text",
